{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31450","headline":"小弟艎南游近书来 · 李羣玉","name":"小弟艎南游近书来","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘南客帆稀，游子寡消息。\n经时停尺素，望尽云边翼。\n笑言频梦寐，独立想容色。\n落景无来人，修江入天白。\n停停倚门念，瑟瑟风雨夕。\n何处泊扁舟，迢遰湍波侧。\n秋归旧窗竹，永夜一凄寂。\n吟尔鶺鴒篇，中宵慰相忆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}